#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat/6/b/1
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "You hear that, Curt? They wanna talk to me!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat/9
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Yeah, yeah."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat/17
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Could it be my looks? My humor? Or maybe my personality?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat/25/b/1
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Maybe. If so, I'm glad they take on charity cases."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat/26/b/1
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Maybe. If so, I'm glad she takes on charity cases."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat/27/b/1
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Maybe. If so, I'm glad he takes on charity cases."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat/47
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "I won't catch you slippin' today, will I?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat/55
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Naw. But I'll slide out of the way so you to can conversate."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/0
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "So, you wanted to talk to me?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah! I wanted to know more about you without Curt around."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm curious about who you are. What's your story?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Oh, little old me? There isn't much to tell."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Except that I've been fly since the day I was welded together."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Naw, but for real, I do take pride in my appearance. It's the first impression, you know?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "And if I'm gonna be hanging out by the window, having everyone look at me, I neeeeed to look goooooooooood, baby."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh trust me. You do. Look good."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You really take fashion seriously, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "You ain't threadbare yourself!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Ha, you didn't buy me because you thought I was ugly, did you? Ha ha."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "But really, this shine and this luster, it ain't easy."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "And a lot of people don't consider what it's like to have to hold someone up all the time."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You mean Curt?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You look like you can handle it."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "I ain't gonna let anyone down, especially Curt. That's my homie."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "He gives me a hard time, but I know he's attached to me, too."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-2/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But y'all make fun of each other so much."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "That's part of the fun!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-2/c-6/15
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "If you can't laugh with someone... what's the point?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-2/c-6/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But I mean, he runs circles around you."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-2/c-6/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "OH! It's like that?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-2/c-6/23/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Game recognizes game. And you look unfamiliar."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-2/c-6/23/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It sure is... sucka!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-2/c-6/23/c-0/15/c-0/16
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Daaaaaamn! All right, you cool. You've been practicing. Good on you."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-2/c-6/23/c-0/15/c-1/16
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "You know what I'm liking about you? You really be trying. I don't know if you be doing, but you be trying."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-2/c-6/23/c-0/15/c-1/24
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "You've been hanging out with us too much. Hahaha."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-3/0/s/0 curtrod_curtain/curt_chat_b/0/g-0/33/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You really don't mind the joking, do you?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-3/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The way you and Curt interact... it can seem kinda harsh."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "It's not for everyone. We know that. But we think it keeps things interesting between us."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-4/8/s/0 curtrod_curtain/curt_chat_b/0/g-2/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you two... in love?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-4/c-9/7
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "What do you mean? Like, that's my homie."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-4/c-9/15
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "OOOOOH! You mean like capital L love?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-4/c-9/23
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Nah. There was a time I thought that maybe we might be. But, we're just friends."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-4/c-9/31
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Why do you ask?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-4/c-9/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can... I be honest with you?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-4/c-9/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Wouldn't have it any other way."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-4/c-9/39/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think your relationship is toxic."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_chat_b/0/g-4/c-9/39/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What if I want you for myself?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_toxic/0/0
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Toxic? What makes you say that?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_toxic/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It feels like you are both mean to each other for no reason."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_toxic/0/9/s/0 curtrod_curtain/curt_toxic/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think he brings out the worst in you."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_toxic/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The way he talks about you? It isn't right."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_toxic/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "You really think so? We've been like this with each other for so long..."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_toxic/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "The worst in me? Like, I'm not sure I know how else to be. I'm my most \"Rod\" when I'm with Curt."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_toxic/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "At least... I think I am."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_toxic/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Every now and then he says something that kinda hurts, yeah. But, that's part of the game."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_toxic/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "I know I've said some things that really cut through his threads before."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_toxic/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Damn..."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_toxic/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "What does all this mean?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_toxic/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You need some time away from each other."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_toxic/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe you should do your own thing for a bit."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_toxic/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "You think so?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_toxic/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "I mean... would you still be around if I did?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_toxic/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Only if you really took time away from him."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_toxic/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Okay, okay. I hear ya."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_toxic/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "I'll be real with you. I've got some thinkin' to do."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_toxic/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "I'd... like to be alone right now."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_toxic/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "I'll see you around."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_flirt/0/0
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Oh, so that's what this is about, huh? Ha, I knew you'd been checking me out."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_flirt/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Good thing it's not humility I'm attracted to."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_flirt/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I mean, you aren't THAT fine, now. Just a little fine."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_flirt/0/c-0/16
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "You've gotten better at tossin' shade. I like that. I like that a lot!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_flirt/0/c-1/16
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Just a little fine, huh? Well, seems that's all I needed to get your attention."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_flirt/0/c-1/24
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "And if that's the case, I'll take it."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_flirt/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "The more you come around, the more I like you."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_flirt/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "I know normally I would follow this up with an off-the-cuff joke, but... I just want to be real with you."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_flirt/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Curt and I talk about you sometimes. Always good things, mind you."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_flirt/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "I even told Curt I had a little crush on you, or whatever."
