#: curtrod_curtain/rod_flirt/0/g-0/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You are such a good friend to him."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_flirt/0/g-0/43/s/0 curtrod_curtain/curt_flirt/0/g-0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you have to."
