#: curtrod_curtain/rod_flirt/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Heh. You're right about that."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_flirt/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "In the spirit of honesty, I know Curt likes you, too."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_flirt/0/g-0/c-3/23
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "There are worse problems to have on your end, but, it is something I want to talk to him about. Before I like... try to make us official."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_flirt/0/g-0/c-3/31
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Is that cool with you?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_flirt/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "I know he'd do the same for me."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_flirt/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Yeah... I've gotta. It's the right thing to do."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_flirt/0/g-0/c-6/7
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "It's a chance I'll have to take. I've gotta do right by Curt."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/rod_flirt/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Come see me again soon, okay? We can chat then."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat/0
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Yeeeah! That's what I'm talkin' 'bout!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat/8
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "One-on-one with the Curty Curt."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat/16
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "You still wanna talk to him after that?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat/24
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Be careful, Rod. Haterade will make you rust."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat/32
msgctxt "Curt and Rod"
msgid "Hahahahaha! My man!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat/49
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "You crazy kids don't stay out all night. I'll just be hanging around here."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat/60
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Catch you later, my dude!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat_b/0/0
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "And what can I do for you?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat_b/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You can tell me about Curty Curt."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat_b/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm interested to hear about you!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat_b/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Oh, you wannna know about me? I didn't realize I made that much of an impression."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat_b/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "The only thing vital to my story is that I'm top notch, baby!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat_b/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "But you knew that. You didn't go with a cheap set to cover your windows."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat_b/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "The thing I like about you is you know quality when you see it, and Curt, yeah, I'm quality."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat_b/0/g-0/32/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I dunno. Rod seems to have the upper hand here."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat_b/0/g-0/32/c-0/7
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "And here we were, having a good time."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat_b/0/g-0/32/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's okay to be jealous. I would be too if I were you."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat_b/0/g-0/32/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's what I said... sucka!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat_b/0/g-0/32/c-0/15/c-0/16
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Oh, you on it today! I see you! I see you!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat_b/0/g-0/32/c-0/15/c-1/16
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Hahaha. No one can say you aren't trying at this whole shade thing. They say you miss every shot you don't take! Keep takin' 'em."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat_b/0/g-0/32/c-0/15/c-1/24
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "But I can tell we're rubbing off on you. You're getting there!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat_b/0/g-0/33/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You and Rod poking at each other... it's kinda odd to watch."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat_b/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Eh, it's just what we do. Not everyone can handle it, but we know we've got each other's backs."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat_b/0/g-2/c-4/7
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Oh, naaaaw. We're just tight like that."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat_b/0/g-2/c-4/15
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Once upon a time, I thought that, you know, maybe?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat_b/0/g-2/c-4/23
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "But we talked about it and realized we were better off as friends."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat_b/0/g-2/c-4/31
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Is that what you wanted to talk to me about?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat_b/0/g-2/c-4/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can I be real with you?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat_b/0/g-2/c-4/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Without a doubt. We only deal in the real!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat_b/0/g-2/c-4/39/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you and Rod are toxic together."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_chat_b/0/g-2/c-4/39/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What if I want more time with just you?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_toxic/0/0
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Hold up. Toxic? I don't think you know what you're talking about."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_toxic/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The way you talk to each other is just awful."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_toxic/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He's always tearing you down. It isn't funny."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_toxic/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "I mean, we can be a little harsh sometimes, but it's not a big deal."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_toxic/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "That can't be true. Rod and I are the best together. The best!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_toxic/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "I don't know who I am without him."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_toxic/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "I say some things that hurt him too, I know it, but like, that's just what we do."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_toxic/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "I mean, I guess sometimes his words have cut through me a bit."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_toxic/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Well, ain't that somethin'..."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_toxic/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "I've never thought of it that way before."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_toxic/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "What am I supposed to do?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_toxic/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You need some space from Rod."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_toxic/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe you two shouldn't hang out."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_toxic/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Oh, for real? You think so?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_toxic/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "But... Rod's like my best friend."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_toxic/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll be there for you!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_toxic/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't worry, you'll have me."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_toxic/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Yeah... yeah. Okay."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_toxic/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "This is a lot to think about."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_toxic/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Thank you for telling me what you think."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_toxic/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "I'd like some time alone right now. I've got some stuff to sort out."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_toxic/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "I'll check you later though, alright?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_flirt/0/0
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "See, I knew it! I told Rod that you've been lookin' at my embroidery. I've seen ya!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_flirt/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's nice. If you are into that sorta thing."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_flirt/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's not your jokes I'm attracted to, that's for sure."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_flirt/0/c-0/16
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "And you are! Don't lie. I know you are."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_flirt/0/c-1/27
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Okay! Okay! I see you out here stuntin' on me!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_flirt/0/c-1/35
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Pile it on. I don't mind at all."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_flirt/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "I've got to admit, I've been eyeing you up, too."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_flirt/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "No joke. You've been hanging out with us more and I can't help but notice how much fun I have around you."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_flirt/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Rod and I have talked about it, but it's mostly just us guessing if you like one of us."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_flirt/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Because... I've been crushing on you. But I wasn't sure if you had a crush on me."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_flirt/0/g-0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You are such an awesome friend to him."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_flirt/0/g-0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What if I don't want to wait?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_flirt/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "True. True."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_flirt/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "I've gotta tell you though... Rod has a thing for you, too."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_flirt/0/g-0/c-3/23
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "I don't think that's a huge thing, but I've gotta talk to him about this before we make this a real thing, you know?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_flirt/0/g-0/c-3/31
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Out of respect for him and his feelings."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_flirt/0/g-0/c-3/39
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "That alright with you?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_flirt/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Rod would do the same for me."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_flirt/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Oh, I've gotta. Rod deserves at least that."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_flirt/0/g-0/c-6/7
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "That's up to you. But, Rod's my homie. I'm not gonna do him dirty."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_flirt/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Let me chat him up and we can figure this all out. Alright?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curt_flirt/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "See you soon!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/0 curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_c/0/0
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Hey! Look who it is!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/8
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Just the human we were hoping to see."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey, you two! What's going on?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You were waiting for me? I'm glad I showed up!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "So Curt and I have been talking."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "A lot. For hours, really."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "And we've been noticing the way you've been acting."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The way I've been acting?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "You can throw shade with the best of 'em."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "And we realize that the fact you can keep up with us —"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "And that you are extremely cute —"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Yeah, that too. All of that has kind of pointed us to one thing."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "We both like you. No jokes, no humor, just truth. We both have really fallen for you."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "And we both want to get to know you even better. But, that brought up a problem."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/g-1/48
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "How do we do that and still respect our friendship?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/g-1/56
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "And we think we have a solution."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/g-1/64
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Why not date both of us?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/g-1/72/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Both of you? At the same time?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/g-1/73/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You mean... like a throuple!?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Both of us. As your lovers. At the same time."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Rod and I love being around each other. And we really like being around you."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "So we figured, what if we can just be around each other all the time?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "It would take some work. We know that. Plenty of communication."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "But, we think it would be great. And that you are worth it."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/g-2/40
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "So... what do you say?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/g-2/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd love to be dating both of you!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_thruple_suggestion/0/g-2/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You know... I don't think it's really for me."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_love/0/0
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Hell yeah!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_love/0/11
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "That's awesome!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_love/0/22
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "We were hoping you would agree!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_love/0/30
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Just think of it. The three of us having the time of our lives."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_love/0/38
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "And if you want to have like... one-on-one dates, we totally get it. I can just hang back."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_love/0/46
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "And I could just slide over to the side."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_love/0/54/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is really exciting."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_love/0/55/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Two beautiful curtains to date! Who could ask for more?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_love/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Don't sell yourself short. We got pretty lucky, too."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_love/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "So... Come see us some time soon?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_love/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Yeah, we know you've gotta get back to work. But we'll be here for you."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_love/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "We'll see you around!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_d/0
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Hey, we totally respect that."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_d/8
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "We get it. We absolutely get it."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_d/16
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Thank you for being honest with us. We wouldn't want you in a situation where you weren't totally comfortable."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_d/24
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "And it doesn't change anything between us."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_d/32
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Yeah! You can still come by and throw shade with us."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_d/40
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "You might be better at it than us now."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_d/48
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Speak for yourself, homie, but yeah, you've got the stuff."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_d/56
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Promise you'll come by and see us? I'm sure Rod's gonna be up to something foolish."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_d/64
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "You can help me put Curt in his place."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_d/72
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "We consider you one of our closest friends now. So come hang with us!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/0 curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_b/0/0
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Hey! How's it going!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/8
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "You have a knack for showing up when you're on our minds."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/16/s/0 curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_b/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I take it you both got a chance to talk?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/17/s/0 curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_b/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hope you had some time to talk things over."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/g-0/0 curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_b/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "We did, yeah. And we've come to some decisions ourselves."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "We both like you. And we batted some ideas around."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "We kept going in circles about what to do."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/g-0/24 curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_b/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "And we also tried to think about what was fair to you. Especially since we know how you feel."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "And... we think it is best if we just stay friends."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/g-0/40 curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_b/0/g-0/64
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "All of us."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/g-0/48/s/0 curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_b/0/g-0/72/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's disappointing."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/g-0/49/s/0 curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_b/0/g-0/73/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's a huge bummer!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "We thought about it, and Rod and I know it would cause some issues between us."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "One of us would end up jealous. And while we like you a lot, we don't wanna put our friendship in jeopardy."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "And we don't want to put you in a situation where you get caught in the crossfire."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/g-1/24 curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_b/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "So we thought this would be best. Let me make one thing clear. We WANT to hang out with you."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Oh yeah! You throw shade with the best of them. Having you around has been a blast!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "And it might be awkward at first, but we'll get through it."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/g-1/48 curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_b/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "We absolutely will."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/g-1/56 curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_b/0/g-1/48
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "How does that sound?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/g-1/64/s/0 curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_b/0/g-1/56/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't think that will work for me. Y'all played me."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/g-1/65/s/0 curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_b/0/g-1/56/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds like a good idea."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "Fantastic! We knew you would understand."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/g-1/c-5/15 curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_b/0/g-1/56/c-5/15
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "That's what makes you so great."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/g-1/c-5/23
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "That, and your jokes, ha-ha!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/g-1/c-5/31
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Oh yeah, you got the fire!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/g-1/c-5/39 curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_b/0/g-1/56/c-5/23
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "So... we'll see you around, yeah?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_a/0/g-1/c-5/47 curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_b/0/g-1/56/c-5/31
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "If you ever need a good laugh, you know where to find us."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_b/0/8
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "You have a knack for showing up when you are on our minds."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_b/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "We both like you. But we realized something."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_b/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Yeah. We are both people who needs someone who can match wit with them. Not saying you're not smart!"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_b/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "It's just the way we joke around is not for everyone and you were starting to get it, but we need someone who can keep up with us."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_friendship_b/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "Rod and I aren't going to slow down with the jokes. To date one of us, means dealing with them all the time."
msgstr ""

