#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_realize_love_path/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Curt and Rod's effortless chemistry as friends translates to a tag team duo of sexual devastation—but lest you fear things have gotten too intense, the two of them keep up their smiles and laughter between rounds."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_realize_love_path/33
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You lie between the two of them afterward, basking in the sweet afterglow of your joining. For a few tender moments, there is no shade. Only love."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_realize_friend_join/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The two don't stick around long. They build an act as a comedy duo, hitting the comedy clubs and rocketing to fame."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_realize_friend_join/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It isn't long before they have a show on the Chuckle Channel, making skits and topical segments. Each episode has a Shade Segment where they use the audience as the butt of their jokes."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_realize_friend_join/22
msgctxt "Rod"
msgid "So, you CHOSE to come to a show dressed like that?"
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_realize_friend_join/30
msgctxt "Curt"
msgid "They have good taste in comedy, not clothes."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_realize_friend_join/55
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Soon, Rod decides to leave the show in order to follow his dream of making socially relevant thriller movies."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_realize_friend_join/66
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Curt continues on, writing and starring in comedy shows and sitcoms."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_realize_friend_join/74
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The two remained the best of friends, even by a pair of homes that connect through a door between them."
msgstr ""

#: curtrod_curtain/curtrod_realize_friend_join/85
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Every weekend they can they go people-watch. They brainstorm new ideas and poke fun at people as they pass by."
msgstr ""
